---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Gallery from '../../components/Gallery.astro';
import ProjectMeta from '../../components/ProjectMeta.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="3D Printer Side Table"
  description="I built a side table out of Red Oak and Pine to place my Ender 3 Pro 3D printer on and to house my PC."
  image="/images/render-4.jpg"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>3D Printer Side Table</h1>
      <ProjectMeta year="2020" details={['Red Oak', 'Pine', 'Ender 3 Pro']} />
    </header>
    <article class="project">
      <Gallery
        variant="triple"
        priority
        images={[
          { src: '/images/img_0169-2.jpg', alt: '3D printer side table' },
          { src: '/images/picture.jpg', alt: 'Side table holding a 3D printer' },
          { src: '/images/render-4.jpg', alt: 'Side table 3D render' },
        ]}
      />
      <p>I built a side table out of Red Oak and Pine to place my Ender 3 Pro 3D printer on and to house my PC.</p>
      <p>
        I used a sort of half-lap joint to secure the column supports with the cross supports. Most of the cuts were made using a table saw or circular saw, and it was stained a Dark Walnut color with a few coats of Polyurethane as a finish.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
